{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51394","headline":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 一 · 李绅","name":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河桥上将亡官军，虎骑长「戟」（战）交垒门。\n凤凰诏书犹未到，满城戈甲如「云」（雪）屯。\n家家玉帛弃泥土，少女娇妻愁被虏。\n出门走马皆健儿，红粉潜藏欲何处？\n鸣鸣阿母啼向天，窗中抱女投金钿。\n铅华不顾欲藏艳，玉颜转莹如神仙（《董解元西厢记》卷二〖2〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}